database-error-relations-pending = The structure of the result's table is being read: try again in a moment.
database-error-no-relations = The result's rows do not come from one known table, so it has no foreign keys to follow.
database-error-no-link = The result has no such foreign key.
database-error-no-row = There is no row { $row }: the result has { $rows } rows.
database-error-null-key = The key holds NULL, so it points at no row.
database-error-tab-closed = The tab "{ $tab }" has been closed.
database-error-no-lookup = No key lookup is open.
database-error-lookup-row = The lookup has no row { $row }.
